{"school":{"dbn":"20K192","name":"P.S. 192 - The Magnet School for Math and Science Inquiry","boro":"Brooklyn","district":"20","district_label":"District 20","report_type":"EMS","report_types":"EMS","school_type":"K-8","grades":"K to 8","status":"open","enrollment":597,"enrollment_year":"2024-25","address":"4715 18 AVENUE, BROOKLYN, NY 11204","phone":"718 833 9363","website":"www.ps-is192.org","directory_url":"https://www.myschools.nyc/en/schools/middle-school/65952","accessibility":"Not Accessible","overview":"P.S./I.S. 192, The Magnet School for Math and Science Inquiry, is a PreK - 8 school. We are a small, diverse community focused on academic excellence and social emotional growth. Our Middle School offers an atmosphere where each scholar is known and celebrated.  Our school offers many accelerated learning opportunities to explore topics such as STEAM, Visual Arts, Spanish, Music and Career Readiness.  We have an array of electives, including sports, chess, acting, science and math olympiads, canvas painting, the green team (student environmental activists), etc.   Our talented, dedicated teachers use data to drive instruction and create lessons using scaffolds and supports to meet the needs of all scholars.  Our school offers all needed supports for SWD's and ENL scholars.   P.S./I.S. 192 offers the NIA afterschool program for all 6th-8th graders. During this program your child will receive homework assistance and extracurricular activities curated to students\u00c3\u00a2\u00c2\u0080\u00c2\u0099 interests, including but not limited to: Sports, Cooking, Graphic Designs and Step Class.  NIA also offers numerous trips throughout the year.  We also have after school band and drama club programs.","start_time":"08:00am","end_time":"02:19pm","languages":null,"subway":"F to 18th Av","bus":"B11, B8","shared_building":"0","neighborhood":"Ocean Parkway","latitude":40.629,"longitude":-73.9798,"coordinate_source":"geocoded","first_year":"2015-16","last_year":"2024-25"},"